			"widgets_values":[
				"[1]Perched contentedly on a plush blue cushion beside a frost-fringed window, a small penguin is engrossed in a miniature storybook. Its black-and-white feathers look soft against the vibrant cushion. Gentle snowflakes drift outside the cozy cabin, visible through the glass. A steaming mug of (imaginary) fish cocoa sits nearby, wisps of \"steam\" curling upwards. Warm firelight from a tiny hearth nearby casts flickering shadows on the log walls, creating an atmosphere of quiet winter comfort. The penguin's beak moves slightly as it silently follows the tale.\n\n[2]On a vast, sunlit ice floe, a young penguin gleefully slides on its smooth belly. Its flippers are outstretched like tiny wings, propelling it across the slick surface with surprising speed. Sparkling turquoise water laps at the ice edges nearby, and towering, sculpted icebergs glow pale blue in the background. Other penguins can be seen waddling or diving in the distance. Crisp air carries the sounds of splashes and joyful squawks. The bright Antarctic sun reflects brilliantly off the pristine white ice, making the scene dazzling and energetic.\n\n[3]Standing proudly on a wooden step stool in a warm, sunlit kitchen, a penguin wears a comically oversized chef's hat slightly askew. It's intently using its beak to carefully press a fish-shaped cookie cutter into golden dough spread on a floured counter. Flour dusts its black feathers like snow. Sunlight streams through the window, illuminating baking trays and bowls nearby. The air smells sweetly of vanilla and butter. A small oven mitt lies ready beside it, and a patient human hand holds the dough steady, completing this charmingly domestic scene."
			],
